sequenceDiagram
accTitle: Exchange a workflow identity token for temporary deployment credentials
accDescr: The approved GitHub job requests an OIDC token. STS checks the registered provider and deployment-role trust conditions before returning a temporary role session used for S3 deployment.
participant G as GitHub job
participant O as GitHub OIDC
participant S as AWS STS
participant B as S3
G->>O: Request workflow identity token
O-->>G: Signed token with audience and subject
G->>S: AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity
S->>S: Verify provider, audience and allowed subject
S-->>G: Temporary deployment-role credentials
G->>B: Authorized deployment operation
